There is NO BMP280 in the circuit at all. If this code runs for 3.5 seconds, what appears in the serial monitor?

```
bool hazir = false;

void setup() {
  Serial.begin(9600);
  hazir = bmp.begin(0x76);
  if (!hazir) { Serial.println("BMP280 bulunamadi"); }
}

void loop() {
  delay(1000);
  if (!hazir) { return; }
  Serial.println(bmp.readPressure() / 100.0, 1);
}
```

